            <note corresp="#d334-f3" n="3" xml:id="d334-f3-content">
                <p>The instructions were contained in circular telegrams 393 and 394, October 25.
                    (Department of State, Central Files, 611.41/10–2557)</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d334-f4" n="4" xml:id="d334-f4-content">
                <p>The memorandum of conversation at the NATO
                    dinner meeting is not printed.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d334-f5" n="5" xml:id="d334-f5-content">
                <p>For the transcript of the Secretary’s news conference, October 25, see Department
